<title>USA: Stormedia president to resign.</title>
<headline>Stormedia president to resign.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>StorMedia Inc said Friday President and Chief Operating Officer Michael Oxsen will be leaving the company effective April 5, to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Chairman and Chief Executive Officer William Almon, will assume his responsibilities effective immediately.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
